Messaging Primitives

A Taxonomy of Cognitive Compilers

Thesis

Communication is not a medium.

Communication is a transformation.

Every messaging method is a different compiler optimized for different constraints.

No compiler dominates.

Each preserves different invariants while sacrificing others.

